        <item>
            <title>0.26.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:21:31 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>58</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.26.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.26.0</h3><ul><li>Keeploop can now keep track of the promises you make in mail you send, like "I'll send the deck Friday". Ask an AI app on your Mac to watch your sent mail: each promise is checked with you before it is tracked, and Keeploop reminds you when one is due. Any AI app can list your follow-ups on any plan; tracking them is part of Pro. Settings and notification buttons for this come in a later update.</li><li>Replies can no longer be filed under (or sent as a reply to) the wrong email.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
